### ================================================================
### TrakCare HL7 Inbound
###
### 1. Build the payload:  python requests/build_hl7.py [a28|a01|a03|oru]
### 2. Edit the < line below to point to the desired file
### 3. Send
### ================================================================

@tcBaseUrl = http://demo01.tcdb.vtas.cl.intersystems.com
@endpoint  = /demo01/tcoffline
# base64("demo:demodemo")
@auth      = Basic ZGVtbzpkZW1vZGVtbw==

GET {{tcBaseUrl}}{{endpoint}}/getData
Authorization: {{auth}}

GET {{tcBaseUrl}}{{endpoint}}/getDataTest
Authorization: {{auth}}

POST {{tcBaseUrl}}{{endpoint}}/hl7inbound
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./hl7_BadMessage.json
